SUMMARY:Homeschool Learning Lab: Felt Dinosaurs
DESCRIPTION:\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\n\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n  
   color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid 
 #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nRoar\, 
 stomp\, and stitch! Make your own soft felt dinos to take home.\na {\n    
 text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr th\, tr td {\n    
 border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: 
 #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n Learn simple stitches and take home a soft dino friend. 
 This program will be held at 10a.m. on Thursday\, July 30\, 2026\, at North 
 Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712. 
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nThe program includes safe\, 
 kid‑appropriate needles and thread. Some motor skill readiness is 
 recommended.\n\nHomeschool Learning Lab meets weekly year-round. In the 
 summer\, we ask for registration in order to help with program prep. Please 
 register each child attending. \n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
 business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best 
 accommodations possible!\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Molly Schaefer":MAILTO:mschaefer@dconc.gov
