SUMMARY:Preschool Process Art: Butterfly Smash Art
DESCRIPTION:Children ages 2-5 are invited to join Ms. Kristen and get 
 creative! Process art is child-directed and embraces the process of 
 creating\, rather than the end result. \n\nThis week\, we'll make beautiful 
 butterflies using cardstock\, paint\, and cotton swabs. \n\nRegistration is 
 appreciated\, but not required. Please dress for a mess. Can't wait to see 
 what you create! \n\n
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Stockdale":MAILTO:kstockdale@dconc.gov
