SUMMARY:Red Cross Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:The summer is filled with long days\, warm nights and countless 
 opportunities to help save lives! Sign up for a slot at 
 www.redcrossblood.org and use the keyword 'southwest library' to find the 
 drive or visit 
 https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/drive-results?zipSponsor=Southwest 
 Library. As thanks for taking time to help patients in need\, you’ll get 
 a $20 Amazon Gift Card by email when you come to give blood. Need help 
 signing up? Give us a call at 919-560-8593.
