DTEND:20260808T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260808T000000Z
SUMMARY:Paint & Share: Recipe Boxes
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Summer Reading with a handmade recipe box filled with 
 family recipes!\n\nAt this program\, participants will receive a wooden 
 recipe box to paint and decorate. Inside\, the recipe box will be filled 
 with family recipes submitted by program participants. Listen to some 
 music\, paint your recipe box\, and get to know other community members 
 through the recipes that they share!\n\nBefore the program\, please submit 
 one of your favorite family recipes. The recipe submission form can be 
 found at the following link:\n\nPainted Recipe Boxes: Recipe Submission 
 Form\n\nAll recipes will be formatted\, printed\, and used to fill 
 everyone's recipe boxes with a variety of community recipes.\n\nAll 
