SUMMARY:Memory Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a monthly activity for people with dementia 
 and their caregivers. Memory Cafes host activities designed to engage in 
 the present\, without the expectations of using short-term memory or 
 forward thinking. This month\, we will celebrate summer reading by making 
 dinosaur zen gardens! \n\nThis program will be held on Aug 14\, 2026\, at 
 10 a.m. at the North Regional Library in the Small Program Room. The 
 address is 221 Milton Rd.\n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or 
 accommodation needs\, please contact me at dpeterson@dconc.gov. We ask that 
 all requests be made at least three (3) business days prior to the event to 
 ensure we can provide the best accommodations possible! Please email me if 
 you plan to attend and have nut allergies so that we can make 
 accommodations.
LOCATION:North Regional - Children's Programming Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Desiree Peterson":MAILTO:dpeterson@dconc.gov
