BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260819T163000Z
DTEND:20260819T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260819T000000Z
SUMMARY:Testers & Tasters Cookbook Club
DESCRIPTION:\n\nFOOD SAFETY NOTICE:\n\nWith the increase in cases of 
 cyclosporiasis in North Carolina and elsewhere this summer\, we will be 
 avoiding all uncooked vegetables and fruits in our Testers and Tasters 
 dishes until further notice. \n\n \n\n \n\nTesters & Tasters Cookbook Club 
 is a place to talk about food and cooking!\n\nCome share your experiments\, 
 experiences\, triumphs\, and tragedies.\n\nThis month we will be 
 celebrating cookbooks that have won a prestigious James Beard Award! 
 \n\nThere will be several cookbooks available to check out at the July 
 meeting\, as well as at the North Regional Library information desk after 
 the meeting. You are also welcome to find a cookbook on your own\, either 
 from your own collection or the library's. \n\nHere is the link to the 
 James Beard Award site where you can see past winners. \n\nAnd here's 
 another site\, which you may find a little more user-friendly.\n\nWhen you 
 know the name of the dish you'll be bringing\, please email the name and 
 source to etobias@dconc.gov.\n\nAnd don't forget some containers for 
 leftovers!\n\nQuestions? Email etobias@dconc.gov or call 
 919-560-0140.\n\nRegistration closes 24 hours before the meeting\, but 
 email me if you've missed the deadline and still want to come.\n\nHappy 
 Cooking to all!\n\n \n\nAll in-person programming is subject to change or 
 cancellation based on current COVID conditions.\n\n
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Emily Tobias":MAILTO:etobias@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Food & Cooking
UID:LibCal-14288-15946882
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/15946882
END:VEVENT
