SUMMARY:Ink\, Stamp\, Create
DESCRIPTION:Long before photocopiers important documents like the 
 Declaration of Independence were reproduced by hand-operated printing 
 presses so people across the country could read them. Discover how to make 
 multiple copies of an image as you experiment with printmaking techniques 
 and create your own masterpiece.
LOCATION:MakerLab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Christina Economou":MAILTO:ceconomou@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts
