SUMMARY:Real Talk! Community Conversation about Health
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your health\, cancer screening\, clinical 
 trials\, or navigating care? Join us for an open community conversation 
 about health and wellness.\n\nThis event brings together community members 
 and health professionals to discuss topics such as cancer prevention\, 
 clinical research\, screening opportunities\, and other health questions 
 that matter to you. Bring your questions\, experiences\, and curiosity as 
 we learn from one another in a welcoming and informal 
 setting.\n\nRefreshments will be provided
LOCATION:SLW Meeting Room - Full Room\, Stanford L. Warren Branch Library (1201 Fayetteville St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Larry Daniels":MAILTO:ldaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
