SUMMARY:This Week In the Lab: Cubelets
DESCRIPTION:Join the Maker   STEAM Team in the Innovation Lab during 
 specified open hours to build simple robots with our Cubelets! Cubelets are 
 circut blocks that allow you to build simple robots by exploring sequence 
 and action with sense blocks\, action blocks\, and battery blocks. \n\nThis 
 is a self-paced activity. You can drop in during the listed Open Lab 
 Hours.\n\nInnovation Lab Open Hours:\n\nSunday and Monday: Closed\nTuesday: 
 closed (*different this week)\nWednesday: closed (*different this 
 week)\nThursday: closed (*different this week)\nFriday: 1pm - 
 5pm\nSaturday: 11am - 1pm and 3pm - 5pm\n\nHours subject to change based on 
 staffing and programming needs.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Caroline Flory":MAILTO:cflory@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Maker, STEAM
