SUMMARY:Trinket Trade at Sherwood Park
DESCRIPTION:Want to declutter after a holiday haul? Have blind box doubles? 
 Is your trinket drawer overflowing? \n\nStop by our pop-up trinket trade 
 and swap and exchange your items with others!\n\nWalk around and see what 
 others bring by or set up a blanket to display your treasures.\n\nNo sales 
 allowed\, only swaps!\n\n \n\nEmail ysoto@dconc.gov with any questions!
