SUMMARY:Friends of the Durham Library Pop-Up DVD Sale
DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Durham Library at Main Library for one 
 of their famous pop-up DVD sales! The Friends will have thousands of 
 movies\, TV shows\, children's educational shows\, and countless other 
 genres available\, all at the rock-bottom price of $1 each. There will be 
 box sets available\, priced at just $1 per disc\, as well as a smaller 
 selection of puzzles and games priced from $3. The best part is that every 
 dollar you spend goes directly back to supporting library staff through 
 programming grants\, continuing education scholarships\, and other forms of 
 morale-boosting support.
LOCATION:Main Library - Café area - 2nd floor\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Main Library":MAILTO:main@durhamcountylibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Friends of the Durham Library
UID:LibCal-14288-17314710
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17314710
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260829T161500Z
DTEND:20260829T181500Z
DTSTAMP:20260829T000000Z
SUMMARY:Open Sew with Connecting with Threads
DESCRIPTION:This class is geared towards tweens and teens who already know 
 how to sew and/or have completed 12 weeks of our Learn To Sew program.  In 
 this program\, they will learn how to complete intermediate level projects 
 from start to finish as they expand their knowledge from basic sewing 
 skills to creating complete projects from a pattern. They will also be 
 making a project to give to someone in our community--perhaps a dog blanket 
 or a quilt for a baby in the NICU.\n\nThe six programs are scheduled for: 
 August 29\, Sept 12\, Sept. 26\, Oct. 10\, Oct. 17\, and Oct. 24. Many 
 projects will take more than one session to complete\, so be sure to sign 
 up for multiple sessions. For tweens (ages 9 and up) and teens Registration 
 is required! You must register individually for each session you plan to 
 attend.
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Caroline P.":MAILTO:cbpeterson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts
UID:LibCal-14288-17349107
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17349107
END:VEVENT
