SUMMARY:Teen Game Day!
DESCRIPTION:\nTeen Game Day is a weekly hangout where teens and tweens can 
 relax\, connect\, and have fun with a wide mix of games. We have video 
 games\, board games\, and card games for all skill levels—whether 
 you’re into fast-paced competition\, strategic thinking\, or just playing 
 for laughs. Come and have fun with old favorites and new discoveries. Teen 
 Game Day is all about community\, creativity\, and friendly fun!  If you 
 have any questions or concerns\, please contact Mal at 
 mblewett@dconc.gov.\n
